;; store — a database storage library for Brood ("like Ecto, a bit better").
;;
;; Adaptor-agnostic: queries are plain data (no macro DSL, no pin operator),
;; composed with ordinary functions and compiled to parameterized SQL; schema,
;; changeset, and the repo build on that. The actual database I/O is done by a
;; swappable *adaptor* (e.g. `store-postgres`) that implements a small contract,
;; so the library has no dependency on any specific database driver.
(project
  :name "store"
  :version "0.1.0"
  :description "An adaptor-agnostic database storage library for Brood (Ecto-like): queries as plain data, schema, changeset, and a repo over a swappable driver."
  :repository "https://github.com/broodlang/store")
